  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.11,
      "end_seconds": 3.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Right, welcome. Make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.62,
      "end_seconds": 5.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "Hi there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.44,
      "end_seconds": 9.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "start wherever you like, I'm listening"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 9.99,
      "end_seconds": 26.3,
      "duration_seconds": 16.31,
      "text": "mainly I've been feeling tired and low that's why I came. Difficulty getting out of bed was there, you know, but it's gone away on its own"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.13,
      "end_seconds": 45.35,
      "duration_seconds": 5.22,
      "text": "Any weight loss, headache or jaw pain on chewing at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 46.57,
      "end_seconds": 51.57,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "So, uh, no, not a single one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.23,
      "end_seconds": 56.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.0,
      "text": "Okay, did you notice any visual changes?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.82,
      "end_seconds": 59.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "Nope, no visual changes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.52,
      "end_seconds": 62.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 63.9,
      "end_seconds": 66.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "No, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.99,
      "end_seconds": 70.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 72.39,
      "end_seconds": 77.81,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "just a meniscus repair on my knee, four years ago"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 86.72,
      "end_seconds": 89.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.97,
      "end_seconds": 96.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "No, not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.71,
      "end_seconds": 101.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.92,
      "text": "Are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.41,
      "end_seconds": 112.32,
      "duration_seconds": 9.91,
      "text": "I'm on tamsulosin, 0.4 milligrams, at night. Febuxostat. I take it 80 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.57,
      "end_seconds": 121.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.7,
      "end_seconds": 135.5,
      "duration_seconds": 11.8,
      "text": "Yes, an enlarged prostate. Mm, I have gout, for nearly five years. I didn't want to make a fuss, you know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.1,
      "end_seconds": 149.91,
      "duration_seconds": 10.81,
      "text": "Yes, an enlarged prostate and gout are known to us, good to have that clear. Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.59,
      "end_seconds": 155.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.2,
      "end_seconds": 157.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "and your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.27,
      "end_seconds": 162.14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.87,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.73,
      "end_seconds": 165.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "I'll just record a few vital signs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.82,
      "end_seconds": 179.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.2,
      "end_seconds": 204.83,
      "duration_seconds": 6.63,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 14, temperature 36.7, blood pressure 123 over 70, pulse 70."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.74,
      "end_seconds": 208.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.4,
      "end_seconds": 213.64,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "right, we'll look at it together shortly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.6,
      "end_seconds": 219.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Right, let's have a proper look at you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 221.55,
      "end_seconds": 222.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.81,
      "end_seconds": 245.77,
      "duration_seconds": 6.96,
      "text": "The shoulders are painful to move but strength is normal and there is no joint swelling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.98,
      "end_seconds": 249.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "That's the examination finished."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.13,
      "end_seconds": 270.68,
      "duration_seconds": 8.55,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, it fits best with polymyalgia rheumatica. Rheumatoid arthritis is still possible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 271.25,
      "end_seconds": 275.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "I'm scared it's something bad is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.22,
      "end_seconds": 301.56,
      "duration_seconds": 25.34,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like polymyalgia rheumatica, but I'd like to confirm. Let's book blood tests to look into proximal stiffness. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. I'll start you on prednisolone, 15 milligrams, once a day, reducing course. That should help with polymyalgia rheumatica. Report any headache or jaw pain immediately."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.03,
      "end_seconds": 312.49,
      "duration_seconds": 9.46,
      "text": "try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.88,
      "end_seconds": 316.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "Mm-hmm. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.89,
      "end_seconds": 321.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 321.86,
      "end_seconds": 323.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}